1155
01:08:46.193 --> 01:08:47.160
Oh, shit!

1156
01:08:47.260 --> 01:08:49.564
He was meditating!

1157
01:08:57.972 --> 01:09:00.140
Oh, shit, Janet!

1158
01:09:04.946 --> 01:09:05.913
Oh, god, is it bad?

1159
01:09:06.014 --> 01:09:06.914
