1160
01:09:07.015 --> 01:09:07.815
Oh, my god, it's bad.

1161
01:09:07.915 --> 01:09:09.550
Oh, it's so bad, girl.

1162
01:09:09.651 --> 01:09:11.653
Fuck, stay still, stay still,
