No, no. No, no, no, I just...

1189
01:10:39.040 --> 01:10:40.141
Ah...

1190
01:10:40.240 --> 01:10:41.843
Okay, that's...

1191
01:10:41.943 --> 01:10:42.744
Now you're gonna bleed out.

1192
01:10:42.844 --> 01:10:44.078
Yeah. See?

1193
01:10:44.178 --> 01:10:45.445
That's...

1194
01:10:45.546 --> 01:10:46.948
This is exactly
