1259
01:15:54.755 --> 01:15:57.124
and they just
didn't want to leave.

1260
01:15:57.224 --> 01:16:00.061
No, and then we had
some hippies in the '60s.

1261
01:16:00.161 --> 01:16:02.163
They came in
and started a commune,

1262
01:16:02.263 --> 01:16:03.731
